      "description": "<ul>\n<li><strong>New bundled client plugin:</strong> unlocks mounting spots that no server setting could ever reach.</li>\n<li><strong>Thin railings are finally mountable:</strong> some railings have paper-thin collision the game could literally never detect as a surface; the plugin now handles these.</li>\n<li><strong>Tight spots now work:</strong> spots that are geometrically valid but too tight for vanilla anti-clip check now mount properly</li>\n<li><strong>Fixes a vanilla weapon bug:</strong> weapons with broken mounting data (e.g. the TRG M10) were basically unmountable; they now rest properly on the surface.</li>\n</ul>\n",
